  "description": "Stop HTTP 429 \"Rate limit exceeded\" errors from LLM APIs. Complete rate limiting solution with TPM/RPM enforcement, dependency injection support, and character-based token estimation. Use this for custom LLM providers or without SDK integrations. For OpenAI/Azure, install TokenRateGate instead.",
